  "content": "<p>November is just around the corner, and we&#39;ve got a full month of workshops, meetups, community events, and our General Assembly coming up at Munich Maker Lab.</p><p>Whether you&#39;re interested in robotics, CNC machining, stained glass, or simply meeting fellow makers, there&#39;s always something happening at the MuMa Lab! Open Community Days are every Thursday at 18:00.</p><p>Please note that events, times, and dates are subject to change. </p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a>  <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/workshops\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>workshops</span></a></p>",
